# What is AF-1001 made of, at every level?
# Installed as a stored query by the bfo-cco-fleet kit; run with reasoning on (see ../readme.md).
# expected without BFO/CCO: no rows
# expected with bfo_cco:      6 rows: Engine ENG-01, ENG-01 fan module, ENG-01 core module, ENG-01 fan blade set, Targeting pod TP-1, IR camera IRC-1
# why: installedOn and partOf are aligned to BFO continuant part of; bfo_cco:hasContinuantPartTransitive rolls them up to any depth.
PREFIX : <https://example.org/fleet#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX obo: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/>
PREFIX cco: <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/>
PREFIX bfo_cco: <urn:stardog:bfo_cco#>

SELECT ?component
FROM <urn:fleet:kg>
WHERE {
  ?aircraft :tailNumber "AF-1001" ;
            bfo_cco:hasContinuantPartTransitive ?part .
  ?part rdfs:label ?component .
}
ORDER BY ?component
